# DS-0002: no USER directive — intentional. This image is the KERN runner
# baseline: the agent starts as root (docker socket, tool caches) and drops
# to an unprivileged uid per job unless the run trust level allows root.
DS-0002

# DS-0029: apt-get without --no-install-recommends — intentional. Chrome's
# recommends pull the font packages non-ASCII document rendering needs
# (see the comment above the RUN in deployments/ubuntu.Dockerfile).
DS-0029
